<title>USA: CBOE to list Covance Inc options Jan 14.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list Covance Inc options Jan 14.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said Tuesday it would begin trading options on Covance Inc on January 14.</p>
<p>The CBOE said the options would have introductory expirations in February, March, June and September, with opening strike prices of 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2.</p>
<p>Shares of the company, a spin-off of Corning Inc formerly known as Corning Pharmaceutical Services, were down 1/2 at 18-3/4 on a when-issued basis at midday Tuesday.</p>
<p>Covance options will trade in the Bristol-Myers Squibb Co trading crowd, the CBOE said.</p>
